            <div class="card-content">
                <h3 data-i18n="tip1Title">🌱 Ko‘chat eking</h3>
                <p data-i18n="tip1Text">Hovlingizga, maktabingizga yoki mahallangizga ko‘chat eking.</p>
            </div>
        </article>

        <article class="card tip-card">
            <div class="card-content">
                <h3 data-i18n="tip2Title">💡 Elektrni tejang</h3>
