            </div>
        </article>

        <article class="card tip-card">
            <div class="card-content">
                <h3 data-i18n="tip3Title">🛍️ Paketlardan kam foydalaning</h3>
                <p data-i18n="tip3Text">Ko‘p martalik mato sumkalarini tanlang.</p>
